{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-wizz-toys-7-dot-8cm-blue-anchor-wishing-bottle-2607-0180","content_id":"a81f7bd6-8b4f-47e7-9c13-8870d3f75ffd","description":"Product Recall for Wizz Toys Blue Anchor Wishing Bottles presenting a risk to health.","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"file","content_id":"88f9c7f2-f2e6-49ea-8396-023239f05f8b","content_type":"application/pdf","created_at":"2026-07-21T15:31:10+01:00","id":"88f9c7f2-f2e6-49ea-8396-023239f05f8b","title":"Link to product image and PDF","updated_at":"2026-07-21T15:31:10+01:00","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a5f82ae34dfb74772f96c6d/2607-0180-product-recall-wizz-toys-7.8cm-blue-anchor-wishing-bottle.pdf"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"summary\">Summary</h2>\n\n<p>Product: Wizz Toys 7.8cm Blue Anchor Wishing Bottle</p>\n\n<p>Hazard: The product presents a risk to health as the coloured sand included in the bottles may be contaminated with a small quantity of asbestos.</p>\n\n<p>Corrective action: The product has been withdrawn from the market and recalled from end users by PMS International.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"product-information\">Product information</h2>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Type</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Decorative articles/Homeware/Gardenware - Ornaments (Non Powered)</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Brand</td>\n      <td>Wizz Toys</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Model</td>\n      <td>779025</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Barcode</td>\n      <td>5050565779441</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Country of Origin</td>\n      <td>China</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Description</td>\n      <td>Variety of decorative wishing bottles.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Report and Image</td>\n      <td><span id=\"attachment_88f9c7f2-f2e6-49ea-8396-023239f05f8b\" class=\"attachment-inline\"><a href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a5f82ae34dfb74772f96c6d/2607-0180-product-recall-wizz-toys-7.8cm-blue-anchor-wishing-bottle.pdf\">Link to product image and PDF</a></span></td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2 id=\"hazard\">Hazard</h2>\n\n<p>The product presents a risk to health as the sand inside the bottles may be contaminated with a small quantity of asbestos. Asbestos is a banned substance because it poses a risk to health even at low levels of exposure.</p>\n\n<p>The product does not meet the requirements of the General Product Safety Regulations 2005.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"corrective-action\">Corrective action</h2>\n\n<p>The product has been withdrawn from the market and recalled from end users by PMS International.</p>\n\n<p>We recommend owners stop using the product immediately and keep it out of the reach of children. Follow the below instructions for details on disposal and return of the products.</p>\n\n<p>For further information, access the PMS International website: <a rel=\"external\" href=\"https://b2b.pmsinternational.com/product-recall/\">https://b2b.pmsinternational.com/product-recall/</a> or contact  <a href=\"mailto:productrecall@pmsinternational.com\">productrecall@pmsinternational.com</a></p>\n\n<h3 id=\"disposal-instructions\">Disposal instructions:</h3>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>Stop using the product immediately.</li>\n  <li>If the sand is still in its packaging, place in a heavy-duty plastic bag, double tape it securely, label it clearly and store in a secure location out of the reach of children.</li>\n  <li>If the sand has been used, clean up sites where the product was used using wet cloths to avoid generating dust. Wear gloves and a mask. Double bag the sand, gloves, mask and cloths.</li>\n  <li>Keep children and other people away from areas where the sand has been used until the area has been cleaned.</li>\n  <li>Return the product to store where specified by the retailer for a full refund.</li>\n  <li>If you are unable to return the product to the retailer, follow the steps above and contact your local authority / access their website for guidance on safe disposal of asbestos in your area.</li>\n  <li>For further information, please contact the retailer or visit the <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/guidance/asbestos-in-consumer-products\">GOV.UK page on asbestos in consumer products</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3 id=\"additional-information\">Additional information</h3>\n\n<p>PSD case number: 2607-0180</p>\n\n<p>Lead Authority: Local Authority Trading Standards</p>\n","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-07-21T14:55:16Z"}],"headers":[{"id":"summary","level":2,"text":"Summary"},{"id":"product-information","level":2,"text":"Product information"},{"id":"hazard","level":2,"text":"Hazard"},{"headers":[{"id":"disposal-instructions","level":3,"text":"Disposal instructions:"},{"id":"additional-information","level":3,"text":"Additional information"}],"id":"corrective-action","level":2,"text":"Corrective action"}],"max_cache_time":10,"metadata":{"product_alert_type":"product-recall","product_category":"household-decorative-articles","product_measure_type":["recall-of-product-from-end-users","withdrawal-of-product-from-market"],"product_recall_alert_date":"2026-07-21","product_risk_level":"not-provided"},"temporary_update_type":false},"document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","first_published_at":"2026-07-21T15:55:16+01:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-wizz-toys-7-dot-8cm-blue-anchor-wishing-bottle-2607-0180","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-wizz-toys-7-dot-8cm-blue-anchor-wishing-bottle-2607-0180","base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-wizz-toys-7-dot-8cm-blue-anchor-wishing-bottle-2607-0180","content_id":"a81f7bd6-8b4f-47e7-9c13-8870d3f75ffd","document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","links":{},"locale":"en","public_up